sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant src as __SOURCE_PLATFORM__
    participant hub as __HUB__
    participant tgt as __TARGET_SYSTEM__
    participant dlq as __DLQ__

    src->>hub: __EVENT_TYPE__
    Note over hub: Validate payload
    hub->>tgt: POST /sync (attempt 1)
    tgt-->>hub: 503 Service Unavailable
    Note over hub: Retry up to __MAX_RETRIES__x — exponential backoff __RETRY_DELAY__s
    loop Retry
        hub->>tgt: POST /sync (retry)
        tgt-->>hub: 5xx Error
    end
    hub->>dlq: Route to dead-letter queue
    Note over dlq: Alert ops — manual review required
    hub-->>src: __ERROR_RESPONSE__
